<title>THAILAND: Thai Feb balance of payments turns to deficit.</title>
<headline>Thai Feb balance of payments turns to deficit.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's February balance of payments position turned into a deficit of 26.6 billion baht from a surplus of 24.7 billion baht in January, the central bank said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
